# ---- data: never published ------------------------------------------------
# raw .bin captures (3.5 GB), the 400 MB preprocessing cache and the split
# manifests all live under data/. The split is deterministic (seed 42) and is
# rebuilt with `python -m analysis.split`, so nothing here is required to run.
data/

